Validation scope
The program uses yaml.safe_load to check YAML syntax. The VALID
result confirms that the generated file could be parsed as YAML. It does
not establish that the manifest passes Kubernetes API schema
validation, admission policies, or a deployment in a live Kubernetes
cluster. No cluster deployment test is recorded for this task.
